export_t0_onnx.py contains export-safe rewrites of several tfc-t0
inference functions (causal scaler statistics, input scaling, attention
mask construction, transformer forward). Per the upstream file headers,
parts of tfc-t0 are in turn derived from:
  - Toto (https://github.com/DataDog/toto), Copyright 2025 Datadog, Inc.
  - Chronos (https://github.com/amazon-science/chronos-forecasting),
    Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.
Both licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The t0-alpha model weights (https://huggingface.co/theforecastingcompany/t0-alpha)
are distributed by The Forecasting Company under their own license terms
and gated access; they are NOT included in this repository.

Demo datasets are classic public research datasets (Box & Jenkins airline
passengers; Melbourne daily minimum temperatures, Australian Bureau of
Meteorology; monthly sunspots, SIDC Brussels), fetched from
https://github.com/jbrownlee/Datasets.
